#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:35
msgid ""
"The default GitHub branch may lag a reviewed documentation branch. A branch "
"name, successful clone or documentation release is not a substitute for the "
"exact commit. The previously reviewed documentation snapshot is "
"`5a7a75c321ea173df8692714f95a8df13715293d`; choosing it recreates that "
"snapshot, not later documentation. Its [immutable package "
"manifest](https://x-gen-"
"lab.github.io/nexus/versions/docs-20261014-5a7a75c321ea/documentation-"
"manifest.json) is one concrete example. Use your version's manifest for the "
"current tutorial."
msgstr ""
"The default GitHub branch may lag a reviewed documentation branch. A branch "
"name, successful clone or documentation release is not a substitute for the "
"exact commit. The previously reviewed documentation snapshot is "
"`5a7a75c321ea173df8692714f95a8df13715293d`; choosing it recreates that "
"snapshot, not later documentation. Its [immutable package "
"manifest](https://x-gen-"
"lab.github.io/nexus/versions/docs-20261014-5a7a75c321ea/documentation-"
"manifest.json) is one concrete example. Use your version's manifest for the "
"current tutorial."

